@baseUrl = http://localhost:53425
@organizerToken = paste-new-organizer-token
@viewerToken = paste-viewer-token
@bookingId = 1
@eventId = 1
@tagId = 1
@rowVersion = paste-latest-event-rowVersion
@accessCode = paste-private-code-from-organizer-response

### Organizer profile (once Organizer role is activated)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/me/organizer-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"companyName":"Learning Group","phone":"+995555123456","website":"https://example.com","description":"Practical workshops"}

### Available tags
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tags?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### Create tag; use returned id in tagIds
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Education"}

### Create Draft inside YOUR confirmed booking (adjust future dates and bookingId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"bookingId":{{bookingId}},"title":"Programming Workshop","description":"A practical workshop for students","startsAt":"2026-12-01T10:30:00+04:00","endsAt":"2026-12-01T11:30:00+04:00","maxAttendees":20,"ticketPrice":0,"visibility":0,"tagIds":[{{tagId}}]}

### My events, including drafts/private/cancelled
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/events?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### Details: copy current rowVersion
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/{{eventId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### Publish Draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events/{{eventId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"rowVersion":"{{rowVersion}}"}

### Public catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events?city=Tbilisi&freeOnly=true&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{viewerToken}}

### Private event: create with visibility=1, publish, share the organizer's accessCode
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/private-events/{{accessCode}}
Authorization: Bearer {{viewerToken}}

### Cancel event; its space booking stays confirmed
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events/{{eventId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"rowVersion":"{{rowVersion}}"}

### Alternative: delete an unpublished Draft with its latest version
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/events/{{eventId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
If-Match: "{{rowVersion}}"
